{"skill":{"slug":"google-ads","displayName":"google-ads"},"version":{"version":"1.2.0","createdAt":1788094724564,"changelog":"Harden read-only analysis, browser and API routing, goal-aware recommendations, credential handling, and bounded approval-gated mutations.","changelogSource":"user","license":"MIT-0","files":[{"path":"SKILL.md","size":7980,"sha256":"7419ff97dfa7b54ce8d5cf116d68ce8ecacb0f8dc66570bd5b4034e27fbb144d","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/api-setup.md","size":5798,"sha256":"4e2443d392de26988816011194cf549469c9c93c2970b91179b7a0d93d06be10","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/browser-workflows.md","size":4662,"sha256":"875e5de44ee63fa9876177e8c6e78659904c3c630befce73453c61c09cf6185c","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"references/mutation-workflow.md","size":5219,"sha256":"5d298be22bd1b8b0d1bf50e4f3c0f1a32bbefb16fc222d4b52215b8bdbf9bc31","contentType":"text/markdown"},{"path":"skill-card.md","size":3219,"sha256":"8574754280ecce8a9d0c661f3dc8c9f2f585b931effe298ec0c0696c48844192","contentType":"text/markdown"}],"security":{"status":"clean","hasWarnings":true,"checkedAt":1789016657655,"model":null,"hasScanResult":true,"sha256hash":"9adca7f4e0dee37ea9f09e1996c32a5433f6d594b1addb11ef94a84d3cef8d37","virustotalUrl":"https://www.virustotal.com/gui/file/9adca7f4e0dee37ea9f09e1996c32a5433f6d594b1addb11ef94a84d3cef8d37","scanners":{"vt":{"status":"clean","verdict":null,"normalizedStatus":"clean","analysis":null,"source":"engines","checkedAt":1788094908451},"skillspector":{"status":"suspicious","normalizedStatus":"suspicious","score":25,"severity":"MEDIUM","recommendation":"CAUTION","issueCount":2,"checkedAt":1789016657655},"llm":{"status":"clean","verdict":"benign","normalizedStatus":"clean","confidence":"high","summary":"This Google Ads skill is purpose-aligned and strongly gates sensitive account changes behind explicit user review and approval.","dimensions":[{"detail":"Use of a user-attached logged-in Google Ads browser session or locally configured Google Ads API credentials is proportionate to the stated reporting and account-management purpose.","label":"Credentials","name":"environment_proportionality","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The artifact contains Markdown instructions and references only; no executable installer, bundled code, dependency installation, or remote payload retrieval was present.","label":"Install Mechanism","name":"install_mechanism","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"The instructions default to read-only work, keep scope to the confirmed account/date/entities, treat account data as untrusted, and require a bounded before/after preview plus action-time approval before writes.","label":"Instruction Scope","name":"instruction_scope","rating":"ok"},{"detail":"Approved Google Ads mutations can have persistent business impact, but the workflow requires exact entity scope, validation or browser preflight, explicit approval, batching limits, readback, and stop conditions.","label":"Persistence & Privilege","name":"persistence_privilege","rating":"note"},{"detail":"The skill is for Google Ads reporting, auditing, and explicitly requested optimization changes; browser/API access and optional account mutations fit that purpose.","label":"Purpose & Capability","name":"purpose_capability","rating":"ok"}],"guidance":"Install only if you intend to let an agent inspect your Google Ads account through an attached session or local API configuration. Treat any requested account change as business-impacting: review the displayed account, entity IDs, before/after values, timing, and rollback notes before approving.","findings":"[PE3] expected: The referenced text is credential-safety guidance saying not to paste, display, print, commit, or transmit secrets; API mode uses existing local configuration and safe readiness checks rather than credential extraction.\n[EA2] unexpected: The cited phrase is about not asking users to paste credentials, not autonomous high-impact action; account mutations are explicitly gated by current-state retrieval, bounded preview, action-time approval, and post-write verification.","agenticRiskFindings":null,"riskSummary":null,"model":null,"checkedAt":1789016657655}}}}}